{"parse": {"title": "以骑士之名-02", "pageid": 127812, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-01\" title=\"以骑士之名-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">以骑士之名-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-03\" title=\"以骑士之名-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">以骑士之名</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A6.82.E4.BB.8A.E7.9A.84.E6.88.91.E4.BB.AC\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"如今的我们\">如今的我们</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 如今的我们</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Where We Stand Now</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一座边境小城，被战争席卷后，剩下破败的残骸勉强勾勒出城镇的骨架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>基金会的疏散工作已经展开，街道上一派萧瑟模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>按照地图的指示，“剃刀”先生就在这附近遇上了那位骑士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱站在十字路口，四下张望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>周围门扉紧闭，入眼尽是提着行囊从家中离去的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……那位骑士已经离开这儿了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>——斯塔希！给我站住！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然，街道尽头传来一位妇女着急的呵斥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱刚一转身，腿上便猛地撞上了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小男孩：</div><div>你——你怎么站在这儿挡路呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩儿跌坐在地上，头上的呢帽与手中的东西也一并滚落在地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>真是抱歉，你还好吗，小朋友？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>有哪里撞伤了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱蹲下身来，仔细打量着男孩儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小男孩：</div><div>你别管我，妈妈快要追上来了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩儿敏捷地捞起身边掉落的物品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>等等！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱将正欲逃跑的男孩儿一把拉得趔趄。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不远处，男孩儿的母亲气喘吁吁地向这边跑来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>斯塔希……可以这样叫你吗？发生了什么，为什么要一个人往回跑？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你的母亲很担心你，这附近可不安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩儿用尽了力气也无法从玛尔纱手里挣脱，一张瘦削的小脸涨得通红。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>半晌，眼见逃离无望，他挫败地塌下肩来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小男孩：</div><div>我、我只是想把临别礼物送出去而已！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>临别礼物？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>呼……你这臭小子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩儿的母亲终于追了上来，无可奈何地在他头上敲了一记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>真是谢谢你！我一会儿没注意，他就悄悄跑了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小男孩：</div><div>我才不是悄悄！我说了，要回去送临别礼物，约好的事就要做到！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>都什么时候了，这样耽误下去，万一错过撤离的火车呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男孩儿自知理亏，抿紧了嘴，眼睛里已噙了泪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>您介意向我说说情况吗？我来自圣洛夫基金会，今天会在城内办事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱指了指胸前的徽章。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>如果只是顺手捎一份礼物应该还是可以帮上忙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-634301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小男孩：</div><div>真的吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小男孩激动地挣开了母亲的手，将怀里藏得严实的物品递至玛尔纱面前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这是……盾牌？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一块只有前臂长短的铁质盾牌，做工粗糙，背面固定着一截旧腰带。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红颜料蜿蜒爬过表面的锈迹，隐约显出一座建筑的轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>斯塔希前几日高烧不退，我们正愁找不到药时，城里来了一位骑士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>噢，她和你一样，身上也穿戴着盔甲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>妇女看着玛尔纱的双臂，有些意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>是她治好了斯塔希。为了答谢她，斯塔希想要赠送一块和她身上的纹章一样的盾牌给她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>他的父亲……用铁桶皮勉强做了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>临走时，我收拾得匆忙，忘了这块盾牌已经被收进行李，也就没来得及送出去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>但斯塔希还是找出来了，就闹着要回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……您说的纹章，图案是不是高地上坐落着城堡的模样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"634501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"634501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-634501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-634501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">妇人：</div><div>噢，是的。难道您……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我是这位骑士的战友。我这次就是来找她的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>您方便透露她目前所在的位置吗？以及，她的名字是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陈旧但整洁的民居内，沸腾的水壶呜呜尖叫着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>骑士安静地坐在木椅上，细致擦拭着面甲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>盔甲上已遍布经年累月的划痕，但仍然光洁，是骑士日复一日不曾懈怠的护养结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>敲门声突兀地响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/19/HeadIconSmall-531810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-312710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>请问是阿德海德修士吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门扉将声音稀释得轻而薄，阿德海德却蓦地停下了动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312716.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312716.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312716.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312716.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312716.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312716.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/HeadIconSmall-312716.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312716.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，是我，玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是她不会认错的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手掌开始发麻，她三步并作两步跨至门边，猛地拉开门——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_14\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-3_3_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一张熟悉但也陌生的脸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德曾以莫大的悲伤与愧悔将这张脸深埋在心底，与许多不幸去世的同胞一道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，真的是你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>眼前的人，面容略带疲倦——也许是因为长途跋涉，但无疑是健康的，带着鲜活的温度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不是一具骷髅，也不是一具已然腐烂的尸身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而是活生生的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531802.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-531802.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531802.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531802.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-531802.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531802.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-531802.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531802.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……天主在上！玛尔纱，你还活着？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不自觉地伸出手，那似乎是一个拥抱的姿态，却因过度震惊和无措僵在了原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱没有丝毫犹豫，抱了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是的，阿德海德，我从“死人山”上活了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我很庆幸，你也活着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>战争年代，重逢是一件奢侈的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德长长叹息着，重重拍了拍玛尔纱的背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>进来说吧。初冬的风已能冻人的骨头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>给，斯塔希说好要送给你的临别礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那块粗糙的盾牌如约送到了骑士手上。阿德海德接了过来，仔细打量着这面盾牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>有机会再遇上他们，得好好谢谢斯塔希一家。不是他们，我也没有落脚的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>不过玛尔纱……你是怎么活下来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱捧着热茶，水汽将她话语中的残酷消弭了些许，染上温暖的湿气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我的确受了伤，但那副厚实的盔甲让那道伤口变得并不致命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这才让我有机会等到一支医疗救援小队发现我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>在他们的照顾下，我痊愈了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>所以你的盔甲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>就是在那时损坏的，虽然没法再穿着，但我并未舍弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>现在的战场环境，士兵也不再适合穿着全甲了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……的确，骑士也只是士兵而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德认得出，如今的玛尔纱身着护士服，只有臂甲昭示着她本应有的身份。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而这身与骑士着装并不相符的服装上，还嵌着一枚会引起她反感的标识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，你为什么会一个人出现在这里？骑士团的同胞们呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德啜饮了一口热茶，将许多质疑暂时咽了下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……骑士团发生了很多事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我现在，是骑士团代理大团长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>当骑士团大团长意外离世之时，团长之位将由资历最深厚的骑士临时接替。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是所有骑士都了然于心的传统。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>赫尔曼团长怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>是你想的那样，他死了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱不禁倒抽了一口凉气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……怎么会？什么时候的事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>半个多月前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我完全没有听闻……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>重塑之手控制军队的证据被披露后，他们走上明面，发动了针对人类的全面战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>他们渗透得太深，以至于大部分通讯网络掌握在他们手里，陷入瘫痪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你离开骑士团太久，不知道也是正常的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>埋藏在宽慰里的些许批评，让玛尔纱不禁握紧了茶杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赫尔曼大团长，领导骑士团超过十年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱在修道院生活的日子里，并未与赫尔曼有过多接触。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在年幼的孩子看来，赫尔曼忠诚勇武，不苟言笑，甚至有些古板，令人敬畏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>赫尔曼团长……是怎么死的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但没有人会怀疑赫尔曼作为骑士团团长的品格。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>他在指挥部里遇刺，但被伪装成自尽——我去过现场，有细微的搏斗痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>但军队的刻意隐瞒，让这件事不了了之。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>我查阅了赫尔曼死前的信件与日记，他那时应该发觉了军队里有重塑之手的影子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……赫尔曼团长忠于皇帝，绝不会投靠重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>在他死后，重塑之手浮上水面，在外作战的骑士们失去了目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>他们唯独清晰地知晓了一件事——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>骑士团遭遇了背叛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>现在的骑士团没有办法继续为帝国服务了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>有不少骑士离开了前线，他们想要回到高地城堡，企图复现中世纪骑士王国的历史。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>可我们不是生活在中世纪的人，这个时代是无法实现这种理想的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>是啊，但现实一旦超越人的理解，本能会指引人们回到传统，用以填补背叛造成的空无。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>然而讽刺的是，等到他们回去，他们只发现了一座被重塑之手劫掠一空的城堡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德放下茶杯，陶瓷杯底与桌面磕出清脆的响声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>骑士团世代积累的财富，这些象征荣誉的回报，被重塑之手野蛮地盗走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>发动战争需要金钱。而我们的宝库，就这么滋养了他们的阴谋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱闭上了眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>高地城堡，她自小生活的地方。她熟知城堡里每一间房，每一条回廊，每一根立柱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对她而言，高地城堡意味着“家”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>油然而生的屈辱与愤怒迅速席卷了玛尔纱，但多年来的训练，又让她熟练地以神秘术将这些情绪收敛起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……希望城堡本身还能保持完好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但在所有情绪被妥善隐藏的一刻，理智让玛尔纱迅速意识到了什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>等等，阿德海德，这就是你滞留在这里的原因吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，你果然是作为基金会的成员前来的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-02"}}